        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Removing documentation of the <code class="notranslate">offline-enabled</code> manifest key, which was supported by Chrome in Manifest V2 (Firefox and Safari never supported this key). The feature was marked as deprecated in <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/25117" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/25117/hovercard">WebExtensions - fix up all the tags except for apis</a> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1612323920" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/25117" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/25117/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/25117">#25117</a>. Chrome ceased support for Manifest V2 in version 139.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44817.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4919667433" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44817" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44817/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44817">#44817</a><br>
